WEBVTT

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:08.180
I see. That's how it was.

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.920
You wanted to separate Raiko and me to seal away the Golden Knight.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.820
Was that your plan?!

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.190
Can you still see the light, Seimei?

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:27.830
Well? Have your gates of darkness opened yet?

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:56.950
<i>A seal guarded since ancient times</i>

00:00:56.950 --> 00:01:04.940
<i>Now it falls and turns to thorns</i>

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:12.150
<i>Remnants of resentment brought to</i> <i>life by the darkness of night take breath</i>

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:21.220
<i>What does that pyre desire</i> <i>and why does it beckon</i>

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:30.570
<i>The flowers of darkness</i> <i>that fear and hate the light</i>

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>Rakshasa, who dances</i> <i>wrapped in a cloak of blood</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:46.280
<i>Release and call back the golden armor</i>

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:56.300
<i>The blade, which can cut</i> <i>through inevitable destiny</i>

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:02.460
<i>Night of the crimson moon</i>

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:06.980
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:11.980
"SEIMEI"

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.440
Here to report.

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.210
The Raise Gate has been destroyed.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:20.670
However, the incident has not spread into the city.

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.340
Brother, I am glad you are safe.

00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:42.740
Where is Seimei-<i>san</i>?

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.310
So many people died because of me...

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:53.980
Please remove the seal!
Just like you did once before.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:57.050
Let me don my armor freely!

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.090
I cannot.

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:03.990
Right now, you blame yourself for everything and seethe with anger.

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:09.830
If I release the seal now and you call forth your armor,

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:13.030
it will crush your very being.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:15.100
I realized it last time.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.040
True, you are strong.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:19.040
But you are also quite precarious.

00:03:19.040 --> 00:03:21.280
Your feelings are so unwavering

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:24.580
that you do not hesitate to sacrifice yourself for it.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:30.950
That is why Kiyome uses her own life to keep you sealed.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:34.360
It is not to make you her own.

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.960
Uses her life...?

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.390
What do you mean?!

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:39.790
Do you not realize it?

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:44.530
Kiyome casts the spell of sealing on you without rest.

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:46.400
Even this very moment.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.540
It drains a vast amount of spiritual energy,

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:53.980
so she must already be adding her life force to sustain it.

00:03:53.980 --> 00:03:55.610
Remember this.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:04:00.380
Seimei is the only human capable of keeping you sealed.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.910
There is another--

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:09.990
Raiko!

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:22.970
I see. That thing was a cradle filled with Horrors!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.410
Raiko!

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:46.760
Why?

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.290
What's going on?

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:54.340
Are you telling me my powers have weakened?

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:55.840
It can't be!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:00.880
Well? Have your gates of darkness opened yet?

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:05.710
That darkness within you will never disappear.

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.160
Poor Seimei.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.030
It is almost time.

00:05:19.030 --> 00:05:20.060
Go.

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:21.190
Yes.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:24.630
Hilarious.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.070
I was so worried about the state of others,

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:30.640
I failed to maintain my own state.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.040
Get ahold of yourself.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:35.510
There is no way their plans have ended here.

00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:39.110
This is just a means to an end.
What is their goal?

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:41.880
A nest of evil spirits?!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:45.590
They appear in swarms. At this rate...

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:49.490
Yasunori. I trust the Light Palace is secure?

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:50.490
Yes!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:57.570
If we close the twelve gates and have the Onmyouryo place a barrier,

00:05:57.570 --> 00:06:02.370
not even a single rat... will be able to escape.

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:08.070
The old fool, Abeno Haruaki will soon fall.

00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:10.550
Bastard!

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:15.180
And the Light Palace will become a wonderful feeding ground.

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:21.960
Yasunori, though you are an <i>onmyou</i> professor,

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.020
you allowed an evil spirit to possess you!

00:06:28.730 --> 00:06:30.700
Minister of the Left, please come this way.

00:06:31.370 --> 00:06:34.530
An evil spirit! Attack! Attack!

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:06.100
Not yet. This is nothing near the darkness I wish for!

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:09.090
This is merely the beginning.

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:12.100
"Raise Gate"

00:07:34.930 --> 00:07:37.300
Seimei.

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.200
Ashiya Douman.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.660
Why, Seimei?

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:49.440
Why did you keep quiet?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.880
The fact that you have to maintain the spell...

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:55.680
Why did you keep quiet the fact you were using your life force?!

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:56.950
That much is obvious!

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:57.820
Huh?

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:01.890
Brother, it is cruel to make me say these words to you.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:05.660
Seimei-<i>san</i> moved according to her feelings for you.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.130
Seimei's feelings for me?

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:19.370
Middle Counselor, please take care of the Minister of the Left.

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.040
Yasumasa.

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:23.540
There is somewhere I must go.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.040
I understand.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.480
Yasusuke.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:45.000
Such a stubborn woman.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:49.770
However, it seems your
Makai Knight is nowhere in sight.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:52.070
Create a disturbance at the Raise Gate,

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.740
then attack the lightly guarded Light Palace.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:09:00.010
The barrier is still up, so you must have snuck the Horror in.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:03.620
Even if you realized our motive, what can you do?

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:07.050
You, who have no Golden Knight to depend on?

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:09.760
Unless I had some kind of disadvantage like that,

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:13.260
it'd be no fun teaching a lesson or two to an inferior junior student

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:15.290
with a face full of cracks like you.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:17.860
Here I come!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.740
The gate opened!

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.580
Thank goodness!

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:32.780
You planned this!

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:34.450
You're welcome.

00:09:34.450 --> 00:09:36.620
Being tricked by this level of acting,

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.120
you really are the most worthless among the worthless.

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:43.490
Fine, Douma Houshi ordered me not to involve myself with you.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:47.390
Get swallowed up in the whirlwind of your own darkness!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.400
"I'm back."

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:56.130
I leave that thing to you.
I'll take care of Douman.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:01.440
"Together."

00:09:58.410 --> 00:09:59.970
No! Not that thing!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:03.840
It's a butterfly and it's huge!
I don't like them!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:08.580
"You have to face your fears."

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.280
Why are you lecturing me?!

00:10:05.280 --> 00:10:09.320
You're just a <i>shiki</i> doll!
Who do you think is controlling you?!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:14.160
I see. It's me. This is the voice of my heart.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:15.590
If that's the case!

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.090
I can't do it, after all!

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:32.270
I dislike the thought of saving aristocrats,

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:37.280
but I hate letting an aristocrat turned Horror roam free even more!

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:38.780
Don't let your guard down.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:46.080
Come!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:05.000
Seimei was protecting me?

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.470
And she used her life force in doing so?

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.300
Don't make me laugh.

00:11:09.300 --> 00:11:11.870
"It's impossible to save everyone."

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:14.340
That's her favorite phrase!

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:17.380
But, I'm different. I want to save them.

00:11:17.380 --> 00:11:21.340
Even if others laugh at my inexperience or see me as reckless!

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:24.850
I want to save as many people as I can!

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:31.460
The same can be said for Seimei-<i>san</i>!

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:35.560
Then why did she let all these people die?!

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:40.570
You just saved my life.

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:47.980
And you will continue saving many lives because Seimei-<i>san</i> chose you!

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:52.980
If she didn't choose you, more lives would have been lost in the end.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.710
Are you all right with that?

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:58.990
Haruaki-<i>sama</i>!

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.080
This is nothing. More importantly...

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.160
They're...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.660
Such a blunder!

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:10.000
Ashiya Douman's true aim is the Light Palace!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.930
It seems we have been distracted with the bait.

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:15.100
What did you say?!

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:17.740
Then, there must be a Horror inside!

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.740
Kiyome?

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:23.510
Why? Why are you there, Kiyome?!

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:25.710
Seimei is there alone?

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:27.080
Seimei-<i>san</i>!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:03.080
Well, Makai Alchemist, who has almost drowned in her own darkness.

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:06.380
How long can you keep your strength?

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:34.150
Raiko, the one chosen by the Golden Armor,

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:37.120
was a man of destiny for you.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:52.970
In a world where all people cannot be saved,

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:57.030
he stubbornly tried to do just that.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.420
Raiko was your hope.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:49.020
The single light that shone through the darkness.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:53.430
You crushed that light beneath your own foot.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:56.160
You and I killed those people!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.200
This is the end.

00:14:57.200 --> 00:15:00.330
Wait, Raiko. Please wait!

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:04.100
I know. I understand.

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:08.080
The anguish you felt when you chose Raiko over the others.

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:14.250
But the foolishness of snuffing out the light you cherished most,

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:17.690
That was your fatal mistake.

00:15:20.220 --> 00:15:23.760
You did well.

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:32.190
Just give your body to the darkness and let yourself rest.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.560
Shiki.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:35.860
"I'm sure"

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:37.570
"Raiko"

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:39.830
"will come back."

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:41.870
"Seimei."

00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.300
"Raiko."

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:44.870
"Together."

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:46.750
"One."

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:51.620
Right. You're right.

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:54.250
I've been lectured by you all day today.

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:07.740
Oh? You still fight back?

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.900
But no matter how much you struggle,

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.770
you cannot stop him in your current state.

00:16:19.850 --> 00:16:23.620
Seimei, could you really be thinking the same?

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:26.450
Do you really want to save as many people as possible?

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.620
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:32.120
I planned to keep this a secret from you, but...

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:38.030
The things I love sparkle with light!

00:16:38.030 --> 00:16:41.640
That's why, Raiko will definitely shine!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.440
Seimei said something like that?!

00:16:43.440 --> 00:16:45.810
To be honest, it got on my nerves.

00:16:45.810 --> 00:16:50.840
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, you are a man who can one day don the Golden Armor himself.

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:55.050
However, Seimei's unconditional devotion to you is true.

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:57.850
It is as Yorinobu-<i>sama</i> says!

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:02.860
Seimei went that far...?

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:05.530
Raiko will definitely return.

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:07.700
Because of my immaturity...

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:10.000
He will come to my side!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.400
I forced Seimei to sacrifice herself.

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.640
That's because Raiko and I...

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:16.200
Then, this time...

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:18.170
The two of us are one!

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:19.970
I will be the one to save Seimei!

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:30.310
Raiko removed the seal himself?

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.100
You finally did it.

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:48.840
Oh, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:51.570
I am one who protects! The Golden Knight!

00:17:58.910 --> 00:17:59.780
Brother!

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:00.680
Raiko!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.550
This is his true form!

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:41.390
Huh?

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:45.760
I-Is that you, Raiko?!

00:18:47.160 --> 00:18:48.420
Seimei.

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:55.740
Impossible! Why is the Golden Knight here?!

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:58.340
You're late, Raiko.

00:18:58.340 --> 00:19:01.610
You're looking quite manly.

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:03.240
I guess so.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:04.610
Let's finish this quickly!

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:05.840
Understood!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:41.210
Damn you! Just wait!

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.060
I see. You hate me that much?

00:19:52.060 --> 00:19:54.830
Good. Hate me! Hate me!

00:19:54.830 --> 00:20:00.730
I would be honored to feed your darkness and turn you into a Horror!

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:05.230
Look! The gate is opening! It's opening!

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:26.090
Fool. To think you'd turn your own body into a gate!

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:28.690
Why did you stop me?

00:20:29.530 --> 00:20:32.400
You know you would not be able to return.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:37.540
That is of no matter!

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:41.700
The darkness I desire is far deeper than yours!

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:53.690
I can't believe you were able to remove the seal yourself.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:58.230
It looks like you're a full-fledged Golden Knight now.

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.430
Yeah.

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:04.530
Seimei, I have something important to tell you.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:05.970
What?

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.400
Everything until now.

00:21:07.400 --> 00:21:11.710
That is... There are many things I must make right. I...

00:21:11.710 --> 00:21:13.910
You peeked on me while I was changing?

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.210
I didn't! I...!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:19.110
So you watched Shiki-<i>chan</i> change? No way.

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:21.750
I didn't! Listen to me seriously!

00:21:21.750 --> 00:21:24.280
Who cares about what happened in the past.

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:26.720
Think about the future.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:27.490
Goodbye.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:31.760
Huh? What do you mean, Seimei?

00:21:31.760 --> 00:21:35.400
I'm too busy to take care of a Makai Knight

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:38.000
who has finally left the nest.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:40.650
Wait, Seimei! Wait...

00:21:45.510 --> 00:21:46.740
Kiyome.

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:48.440
Seimei-<i>san.</i>

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:10.760
Darkness, huh?

00:22:31.020 --> 00:22:37.990
<i>Illusions of darkness</i> <i>reflect where there is light</i>

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:44.970
<i>The way of the current world is so fleeting</i>

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:52.140
<i>The fluttering butterfly that</i> <i>is drowning within your dreams</i>

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:58.880
<i>Will only disappear if you</i> <i>reach out gently to touch it</i>

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:02.650
<i>The dancing of the glowing flames (sweetly)</i>

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:06.090
<i>The flower-like music (far away)</i>

00:23:06.090 --> 00:23:09.220
<i>The elegance of the moon</i>

00:23:09.220 --> 00:23:11.860
<i>Warmth that does not return (gently)</i>

00:23:11.860 --> 00:23:16.530
<i>Hold me (look for the light of twilight)</i>

00:23:16.530 --> 00:23:23.540
<i>Dance up high, passing</i> <i>everything down the family crest</i>

00:23:23.540 --> 00:23:30.010
<i>The heart you want to protect</i> <i>even to the end of all memory</i>

00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:37.250
<i>Dance and bloom proudly,</i> <i>these lights that call each other</i>

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:40.550
<i>Will overlap and shine again</i>

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:48.260
<i>These crimson flowers</i> <i>of oath that drift to and fro</i>

00:23:51.030 --> 00:24:01.040
"Next Episode: SOUL MOON"

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:54.400
A distorted mirror.

00:23:54.400 --> 00:23:59.200
True beauty is in the eye of each beholder.
